# The floppy intro's named dumpScreen checkpoints are captured as each scene
# completes (fast render, one frame per scene). The wait gives the fast
# pass enough real time to reach the throne room; keep the engine alive in
# the first room long enough for the audio window to prove the mixer is not
# silent.
#
# Comments after '#' on a command line say what a click hits and what a
# wait lets finish; scripts/dune_script_trace.py prints what each line did.
wait 15000              # the intro plays through to the throne room
checkpoint floppy-landing
checkpoint floppy-room-scripted
wait 5000               # stay in the room: the audio window
# Paul's head opens the globe with the game menu (EXIT GLOBE, SEE RESULTS,
# SAVE GAME, LOAD GAME, OPTIONS & QUIT GAME). SAVE GAME (third row) lists
# Log 1, Log 2 and Cancel, as the original does; Cancel returns to the menu.
move 160 155            # the pointer (the checkpoint records the cursor)
click left 160 155      # the box's top edge under Paul's head: the globe
wait 4000               # the globe opens
checkpoint floppy-globe
move 160 179
click left 160 179      # row 3: SAVE GAME: the save list
wait 1500               # the list opens
checkpoint floppy-menu-save
move 160 179
click left 160 179      # row 3: Cancel: back to the globe menu
wait 1500               # the menu comes back
# EXIT GLOBE (the first row) leads to the flat map, as in the original: its
# DUNE MAP title popup (seg000:5bb0), the map menu (seg000:878c) and the
# planet in the left panel.
move 160 163
click left 160 163      # row 1: EXIT GLOBE: the flat map
wait 3000               # the map draws with its DUNE MAP popup
checkpoint floppy-map-flat
move 160 163
click left 160 163      # row 1: EXIT MAPS: back to the throne room
wait 1000               # the room draws
# Duke Leto's opening conversation: the second command row, then a tap per
# page (view area) until the throne room returns.
move 160 171
click left 160 171      # row 2: DUKE LETO ATREIDES: “I'm the Duke Leto Atreides, your father”
wait 1500               # Leto's first line shows
checkpoint floppy-leto-1
move 160 80
click left 160 80       # view: next line “My son, we must mine the spice…”
wait 1500               # the line shows
checkpoint floppy-leto-2
click left 160 80       # view: next line “We've spotted three troops of Fremen…”
wait 1500               # the line shows
checkpoint floppy-leto-3
click left 160 80       # view, after the last line: closes the talk
wait 1000               # back to the throne room
quit
